{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_7","type":"agent_message","text":"{\n  \"prompt\": \"Use case: stylized-concept. Create a Minecraft builder reference sheet, landscape 3:2, crisp detailed voxel style, vanilla Minecraft blocks only, plain light background, sunny warm lighting, no characters or animals. Two complete views SIDE BY SIDE: LEFT straight-on front elevation, orthographic; RIGHT three-quarter view of the same entire site at the same scale. Fit all eight modules in both views without cropping. Label views and use small legible block-id palette annotations below the views. Skilled human builder quality: real massing, deep porches, proud corner posts, recessed framed openings, real stepped roof verges, eaves and ridges, sub-block stairs/slabs/fences/trapdoors/lantern detail. All parts obey the Minecraft voxel grid.\\nSite is a Southern cotton-mill village street circa 1900, 96 blocks wide and 19 deep: straight lane 5 blocks deep plus plots 14 blocks deep. Lane runs left to right, dirt and gravel with wheel ruts. Eight modules in exactly this order, each behind low picket and post fences with one centered gate; spruce-post lantern at every plot boundary. One storey on piers, house ridges y11-12, store false front y12.\\n0: Narrow cream birch-clapboard shotgun house, gable faces lane, red brick piers, birch fence-lattice skirting, light grey polished_andesite stair/slab tin roof, small shed-roof front porch with white stripped_birch_log posts, double birch_door, dark_oak_trapdoor side shutters. Brick chimney with deepslate_bricks band beside EAST eave, thin campfire smoke.\\n1: Brown spruce board-and-batten saddlebag duplex, long side faces lane, two spruce front doors under one long porch, rusty red mangrove stair/slab tin side-gable roof, fat brick chimney through center ridge.\\n2: Honey oak clapboard hall-and-parlour cottage, white stripped_birch_log corner boards, paired windows on each side of oak door, full front porch, dark spruce stair/slab wood-shingle side-gable roof, brick chimney at WEST gable.\\n3: Mirrored shotgun, pinkish-tan jungle_planks with stripped_dark_oak_log trim, birch_trapdoor pale shutters, green weathered_cut_copper stair/slab painted tin roof, chimney WEST side.\\n4: Fenced kitchen garden, distinct rows of wheat, carrots, potatoes, beetroots on dark farmland; water channel across middle and plank footbridge on center path; composter, barrel rain barrel, carved_pumpkin-headed hay_block scarecrow on oak_fence.\\n5: Small spruce chicken coop on cobblestone piers, tiny gable roof, slab chicken ramp, visible hay_block and barrel nesting boxes through opening, fenced empty run with trapdoor feed trough and water_cauldron water tub. No chickens.\\n6: Open yard, round stepped cobblestone well with little oak stair/slab roof and hanging lantern, plank bench, large leafy oak tree, grass and podzol patches, wash line of white sheets using white_wool/white_carpet and pale-blue-looking sheets using pale lighting on white blocks on fence rail.\\n7: Company store, dark_oak_planks building, cream birch_planks flat stepped false front above low grey polished_andesite tin roof, dark stair/slab bracketed cornice; black banner letters spelling exactly \\\"STORE\\\"; two large glass_pane shop windows, glazed double doorway represented with dark_oak_door and glass_pane transom; shed porch on posts, hanging wooden sign reading exactly \\\"MILL CO\\\", porch lanterns. Through windows show counter, stacked shelves, barrels and chest crates, composter, smoker, loom, fletching_table.\\nLanterns glow beneath every porch. Use campfire smoke only, no cartoon smoke blocks. Use these EXACT Minecraft block ids as the material palette, grouped by role: {\\\"ground\\\":[\\\"grass_block\\\",\\\"coarse_dirt\\\",\\\"podzol\\\",\\\"rooted_dirt\\\",\\\"dirt_path\\\",\\\"gravel\\\",\\\"dirt\\\",\\\"stone\\\",\\\"farmland\\\",\\\"water\\\"],\\\"masonry\\\":[\\\"bricks\\\",\\\"brick_stairs\\\",\\\"brick_slab\\\",\\\"deepslate_bricks\\\",\\\"cobblestone\\\",\\\"mossy_cobblestone\\\",\\\"cobblestone_stairs\\\"],\\\"plot0\\\":[\\\"birch_planks\\\",\\\"stripped_birch_log\\\",\\\"birch_fence\\\",\\\"birch_fence_gate\\\",\\\"birch_door\\\",\\\"dark_oak_trapdoor\\\",\\\"polished_andesite\\\",\\\"polished_andesite_stairs\\\",\\\"polished_andesite_slab\\\"],\\\"plot1\\\":[\\\"spruce_planks\\\",\\\"stripped_spruce_log\\\",\\\"spruce_fence\\\",\\\"spruce_fence_gate\\\",\\\"spruce_door\\\",\\\"mangrove_planks\\\",\\\"mangrove_stairs\\\",\\\"mangrove_slab\\\",\\\"dark_oak_stairs\\\",\\\"dark_oak_slab\\\"],\\\"plot2\\\":[\\\"oak_planks\\\",\\\"stripped_birch_log\\\",\\\"birch_fence\\\",\\\"oak_door\\\",\\\"spruce_trapdoor\\\",\\\"spruce_stairs\\\",\\\"spruce_slab\\\"],\\\"plot3\\\":[\\\"jungle_planks\\\",\\\"stripped_dark_oak_log\\\",\\\"dark_oak_fence\\\",\\\"dark_oak_fence_gate\\\",\\\"jungle_door\\\",\\\"birch_trapdoor\\\",\\\"weathered_cut_copper\\\",\\\"weathered_cut_copper_stairs\\\",\\\"weathered_cut_copper_slab\\\",\\\"dark_oak_stairs\\\",\\\"dark_oak_slab\\\"],\\\"decks\\\":[\\\"oak_planks\\\",\\\"oak_stairs\\\",\\\"oak_slab\\\",\\\"oak_trapdoor\\\",\\\"spruce_planks\\\",\\\"spruce_slab\\\",\\\"oak_fence\\\",\\\"oak_fence_gate\\\",\\\"oak_log\\\",\\\"oak_leaves\\\"],\\\"store\\\":[\\\"dark_oak_planks\\\",\\\"stripped_dark_oak_log\\\",\\\"birch_planks\\\",\\\"dark_oak_stairs\\\",\\\"dark_oak_slab\\\",\\\"dark_oak_door\\\",\\\"glass_pane\\\",\\\"spruce_stairs\\\",\\\"oak_fence\\\",\\\"oak_fence_gate\\\",\\\"oak_pressure_plate\\\"],\\\"coop\\\":[\\\"spruce_planks\\\",\\\"stripped_spruce_log\\\",\\\"spruce_stairs\\\",\\\"spruce_slab\\\",\\\"spruce_trapdoor\\\",\\\"spruce_door\\\",\\\"hay_block\\\",\\\"barrel\\\"],\\\"garden\\\":[\\\"wheat\\\",\\\"carrots\\\",\\\"potatoes\\\",\\\"beetroots\\\",\\\"composter\\\",\\\"barrel\\\",\\\"water_cauldron\\\",\\\"carved_pumpkin\\\",\\\"hay_block\\\",\\\"oak_fence\\\",\\\"oak_log\\\",\\\"oak_leaves\\\",\\\"white_wool\\\",\\\"white_carpet\\\",\\\"flower_pot\\\",\\\"potted_poppy\\\"],\\\"hearth\\\":[\\\"bricks\\\",\\\"deepslate_bricks\\\",\\\"brick_slab\\\",\\\"brick_stairs\\\",\\\"hay_block\\\",\\\"campfire\\\",\\\"smoker\\\",\\\"furnace\\\"],\\\"jobsite\\\":[\\\"composter\\\",\\\"smoker\\\",\\\"barrel\\\",\\\"loom\\\",\\\"fletching_table\\\",\\\"chest\\\",\\\"decorated_pot\\\",\\\"candle\\\",\\\"oak_pressure_plate\\\"],\\\"light\\\":[\\\"lantern\\\",\\\"iron_chain\\\"],\\\"beds\\\":[\\\"red_bed\\\",\\\"white_bed\\\"],\\\"glass\\\":[\\\"glass_pane\\\"]}. For requested lettering only, vanilla black_banner and oak_sign may be used in addition to palette. No invented blocks, no smooth non-voxel roofs. Palette labels must use exact ids, not generic material names.\",\n  \"roles\": [\n    {\n      \"role\": \"ground\",\n      \"blocks\": [\"grass_block\", \"coarse_dirt\", \"podzol\", \"rooted_dirt\", \"dirt_path\", \"gravel\", \"dirt\", \"stone\", \"farmland\", \"water\", \"short_grass\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"masonry\",\n      \"blocks\": [\"bricks\", \"brick_stairs\", \"brick_slab\", \"deepslate_bricks\", \"cobblestone\", \"mossy_cobblestone\", \"cobblestone_stairs\", \"cobblestone_slab\", \"cobblestone_wall\", \"mossy_cobblestone_wall\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"plot0\",\n      \"blocks\": [\"birch_planks\", \"stripped_birch_log\", \"birch_fence\", \"birch_fence_gate\", \"birch_door\", \"dark_oak_trapdoor\", \"polished_andesite\", \"polished_andesite_stairs\", \"polished_andesite_slab\", \"birch_stairs\", \"birch_slab\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"plot1\",\n      \"blocks\": [\"spruce_planks\", \"stripped_spruce_log\", \"spruce_fence\", \"spruce_fence_gate\", \"spruce_door\", \"mangrove_planks\", \"mangrove_stairs\", \"mangrove_slab\", \"dark_oak_stairs\", \"dark_oak_slab\", \"spruce_stairs\", \"spruce_slab\", \"spruce_trapdoor\", \"birch_fence\", \"birch_fence_gate\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"plot2\",\n      \"blocks\": [\"oak_planks\", \"stripped_birch_log\", \"birch_fence\", \"oak_door\", \"spruce_trapdoor\", \"spruce_stairs\", \"spruce_slab\", \"birch_fence_gate\", \"oak_stairs\", \"oak_slab\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"plot3\",\n      \"blocks\": [\"jungle_planks\", \"stripped_dark_oak_log\", \"dark_oak_fence\", \"dark_oak_fence_gate\", \"jungle_door\", \"birch_trapdoor\", \"weathered_cut_copper\", \"weathered_cut_copper_stairs\", \"weathered_cut_copper_slab\", \"dark_oak_stairs\", \"dark_oak_slab\", \"birch_fence\", \"birch_fence_gate\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"decks\",\n      \"blocks\": [\"oak_planks\", \"oak_stairs\", \"oak_slab\", \"oak_trapdoor\", \"spruce_planks\", \"spruce_slab\", \"oak_fence\", \"oak_fence_gate\", \"oak_log\", \"oak_leaves\", \"spruce_fence\", \"stripped_spruce_log\", \"birch_fence\", \"birch_fence_gate\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"store\",\n      \"blocks\": [\"dark_oak_planks\", \"stripped_dark_oak_log\", \"birch_planks\", \"dark_oak_stairs\", \"dark_oak_slab\", \"dark_oak_door\", \"glass_pane\", \"spruce_stairs\", \"oak_fence\", \"oak_fence_gate\", \"oak_pressure_plate\", \"polished_andesite\", \"polished_andesite_stairs\", \"polished_andesite_slab\", \"black_banner\", \"black_wall_banner\", \"oak_sign\", \"oak_wall_sign\", \"oak_hanging_sign\", \"spruce_planks\", \"spruce_slab\", \"spruce_trapdoor\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"coop\",\n      \"blocks\": [\"spruce_planks\", \"stripped_spruce_log\", \"spruce_stairs\", \"spruce_slab\", \"spruce_trapdoor\", \"spruce_door\", \"hay_block\", \"barrel\", \"cobblestone\", \"cobblestone_stairs\", \"oak_fence\", \"oak_fence_gate\", \"water_cauldron\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"garden\",\n      \"blocks\": [\"wheat\", \"carrots\", \"potatoes\", \"beetroots\", \"composter\", \"barrel\", \"water_cauldron\", \"carved_pumpkin\", \"hay_block\", \"oak_fence\", \"oak_log\", \"oak_leaves\", \"white_wool\", \"white_carpet\", \"flower_pot\", \"potted_poppy\", \"oak_fence_gate\", \"oak_planks\", \"oak_slab\", \"light_blue_wool\", \"light_blue_carpet\", \"poppy\", \"cornflower\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"hearth\",\n      \"blocks\": [\"bricks\", \"deepslate_bricks\", \"brick_slab\", \"brick_stairs\", \"hay_block\", \"campfire\", \"smoker\", \"furnace\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"jobsite\",\n      \"blocks\": [\"composter\", \"smoker\", \"barrel\", \"loom\", \"fletching_table\", \"chest\", \"decorated_pot\", \"candle\", \"oak_pressure_plate\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"light\",\n      \"blocks\": [\"lantern\", \"iron_chain\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"beds\",\n      \"blocks\": [\"red_bed\", \"white_bed\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"glass\",\n      \"blocks\": [\"glass_pane\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"objects\": [\n    \"lantern\",\n    \"iron_chain\",\n    \"birch_door\",\n    \"spruce_door\",\n    \"oak_door\",\n    \"jungle_door\",\n    \"dark_oak_door\",\n    \"birch_fence\",\n    \"birch_fence_gate\",\n    \"spruce_fence\",\n    \"spruce_fence_gate\",\n    \"dark_oak_fence\",\n    \"dark_oak_fence_gate\",\n    \"oak_fence\",\n    \"oak_fence_gate\",\n    \"dark_oak_trapdoor\",\n    \"spruce_trapdoor\",\n    \"birch_trapdoor\",\n    \"oak_trapdoor\",\n    \"glass_pane\",\n    \"black_banner\",\n    \"black_wall_banner\",\n    \"oak_sign\",\n    \"oak_wall_sign\",\n    \"oak_hanging_sign\",\n    \"barrel\",\n    \"composter\",\n    \"water_cauldron\",\n    \"carved_pumpkin\",\n    \"hay_block\",\n    \"wheat\",\n    \"carrots\",\n    \"potatoes\",\n    \"beetroots\",\n    \"flower_pot\",\n    \"potted_poppy\",\n    \"poppy\",\n    \"cornflower\",\n    \"oak_log\",\n    \"oak_leaves\",\n    \"white_wool\",\n    \"white_carpet\",\n    \"light_blue_wool\",\n    \"light_blue_carpet\",\n    \"oak_planks\",\n    \"oak_stairs\",\n    \"oak_slab\",\n    \"spruce_planks\",\n    \"spruce_stairs\",\n    \"spruce_slab\",\n    \"cobblestone\",\n    \"cobblestone_stairs\",\n    \"cobblestone_slab\",\n    \"cobblestone_wall\",\n    \"mossy_cobblestone\",\n    \"mossy_cobblestone_wall\",\n    \"campfire\",\n    \"smoker\",\n    \"furnace\",\n    \"loom\",\n    \"fletching_table\",\n    \"chest\",\n    \"decorated_pot\",\n    \"candle\",\n    \"oak_pressure_plate\",\n    \"red_bed\",\n    \"white_bed\"\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    \"Generated with the built-in image_gen tool and copied without post-processing to concept.png in the current directory; image dimensions are 1536 × 1024.\",\n    \"The image is concept art, not a block placement record. Added IDs are inferred vanilla equivalents for visible forms; exact block states, banner patterns, concealed blocks and some small objects cannot be determined from pixels.\",\n    \"The sheet adds eight individual module close-ups and a large block palette chart beneath the two requested views.\",\n    \"The two main views occupy unequal panel widths and do not visibly maintain the same scale. The front view also reveals roof surfaces and ground depth instead of being a strict straight-on orthographic elevation.\",\n    \"A blue sky, clouds, distant trees and grassy landscape replace the requested plain light background.\",\n    \"The labels assert 96 × 19 blocks, but the rendering does not provide a countable grid establishing dimensions, plot depths or y11–12 heights.\",\n    \"The eight modules retain their requested order. Centered gates and boundary lanterns are not consistently identifiable at every plot boundary.\",\n    \"Most street fences appear pale regardless of the plot-specific fence palette. Narrow pointed pickets and some rail details are stylized forms without exact vanilla block equivalents.\",\n    \"The lane contains irregular grass patches and gravel texture; two continuous wheel ruts are not clearly established.\",\n    \"The birch shotgun shows a single front door instead of two leaves. Its chimney appears on the viewer's left, conflicting with the requested east-side placement if east is right in the elevation. Dark chimney bands, brick piers and fence-lattice skirting are not clearly rendered.\",\n    \"The duplex preserves two doors and a long porch, but its pale street fence differs from the spruce fence palette. Its chimney appears narrow relative to the requested fat central chimney.\",\n    \"The oak cottage has a shallow porch treatment; paired windows on each side of the door are not clearly distinct.\",\n    \"The jungle shotgun also shows a single door. Its pale front fence differs from the dark oak fence palette, and its porch and dark framing are simplified.\",\n    \"The garden includes prominent red and blue flower-like rows beyond the four requested crops; poppy and cornflower are inferred equivalents. The water channel across the middle is not clearly shown as continuous beneath a discrete footbridge.\",\n    \"The garden scarecrow has a tall yellow body and arm-like forms that do not clearly resolve into the requested hay_block and oak_fence construction.\",\n    \"The coop includes a visible ramp and water tub, but its rear run, separate feed trough and interior nesting boxes are not fully readable.\",\n    \"The well is a roughly square stepped masonry structure rather than round. Cobblestone slabs and walls are inferred for its rim and supports.\",\n    \"The wash line shows saturated pale-blue sheets; light_blue_wool and light_blue_carpet are inferred additions. The hanging sheets and line use thin forms that are not faithfully represented by vanilla wool, carpet and fence geometry.\",\n    \"The store adds a brick chimney and smoke that the site description did not request.\",\n    \"The store lettering uses flat banner-like panels, and the hanging MILL CO sign requires sign blocks absent from the supplied palette. Letter-pattern accuracy and vanilla sign geometry cannot be verified.\",\n    \"The store entrance is dark and does not clearly depict a glazed double door. Shelves, barrels and counter-like forms are visible, but individual interior workstations are not reliably identifiable.\",\n    \"Porch flower pots, extra planting and short grass appear throughout the scene.\",\n    \"Several doors, window frames, lantern brackets, roof textures and clapboard courses use fine decorative geometry beyond faithful vanilla block shapes.\",\n    \"The palette chart retains the planned block IDs, including beds and several jobsite objects that are not visibly established in the street scene. Their inclusion in objects records their pictured swatches, not confirmed placement inside buildings.\",\n    \"Palette captions contain malformed or inaccurate labels and some icons do not match their stated blocks; the chart cannot serve as an exact inventory of materials actually placed.\"\n  ]\n}"}}
